<title>MEXICO: Mexico's Tribasa awarded highway contract.</title>
<headline>Mexico's Tribasa awarded highway contract.</headline>
<dateline>MONTERREY, Mexico 1997-04-04</dateline>
<text>
<p>Grupo Tribasa SA on Friday said it won a 181.14 million peso contract from the Communications and Transport Ministry for work on the Palmillas-Queretaro freeway.</p>
<p>&quot;The work program is expected to begin on April 17 and end October 15,&quot; Tribasa said in a statement.</p>
<p>The contract involves work on 22 kilometers of the highway.</p>
<p>((--Monterrey newsroom +528 345-7617))</p>
